Package: heavytailsR
Title: Distributions and Tail Risk Methods for Heavy-Tailed Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Diogo", "Ribeiro",
    email = "dfr@esmad.ipp.pt",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2022-7072"))
Description: Provides native R implementations of probability functions and
    statistical methods for heavy-tailed data. Includes the Pareto type I
    distribution, Hill estimation of the extreme-value index, and analytic
    value-at-risk and expected-shortfall calculations. Uses numerically stable
    expressions for upper-tail probabilities and documents the assumptions of
    each estimator. The Hill estimator follows Hill (1975)
    <doi:10.1214/aos/1176343247>.
